ules-v2","section":"tome-ashes-urhrok/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua","source":"pitch black breastplate","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage":"黑曜石胸甲","target_preimage_sha256":"ecde70c9113dd88b56e4000b8a4454086cf3b17149f0d0b22c7934872862fe14","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/manifest.json","observation_identity":"34c650c58450b09a012c1d91b2c535ac4be6818073fd8d687b37f01677fe37f1","publication_commit":"0ece410c624e79c49761459487c14bc419fd91fa","result_sha256":"3c92307dd7e1cbb9f0160ef63b72e31259b380878014ab1b4bf7bc544acb99c2","results_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/results.jsonl"}},{"call_locator":"18326abbc408f0eeb670eef4ac8af496328f3c9742c4891a3527a598f2c07393","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"318a0c4d708d54d45d22616e4cc54f1aca74a57df6a11f4f769e393cdbfdb383","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:104ad8232778010e72f736559c726ea6ba8291265c28de2ecdf2275ec76dc2f2","logical_entry_identity":"016609ebdc9ab89b6f4c21724206a0d8ee9d22928bcb809ea5bfadbed072fadc","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","proposed_successor_input":{"call_locator":"18326abbc408f0eeb670eef4ac8af496328f3c9742c4891a3527a598f2c07393","component":"ashes-urhrok","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:104ad8232778010e72f736559c726ea6ba8291265c28de2ecdf2275ec76dc2f2","logical_entry_identity":"016609ebdc9ab89b6f4c21724206a0d8ee9d22928bcb809ea5bfadbed072fadc","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","parent_entry_revision_identity":"318a0c4d708d54d45d22616e4cc54f1aca74a57df6a11f4f769e393cdbfdb383","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-ashes-urhrok/data/lore/demon.lua","source":"The modified children of emerald, known as the Wretchlings, willingly accept their role as the arrows in Urh'Rok's quiver, and most only live to see a couple of engagements before giving their lives in battle.  Once in a great while, though, one will stand toe-to-toe with the enemy and repeatedly come out on top.  These outstanding fighters, chosen by fate and their own talent, are recalled, then put through a series of tests to ensure that their survival was not due to luck alone.  Roughly 70% of these are then assigned to breeding duties, ensuring that the Wretchling bloodline gets ever stronger as it is forged in the fires of combat; the rest, whether due to sterility, consuming too much resources to sustain their brood, or simply insisting on staying in the fights for which they were created, are nurtured to maturity and once again let loose on the battlefield.  If wretchlings are our arrows, wretch titans are our trebuchet boulders, causing a tremendous amount of damage to the enemy line with their incredible strength and the geysers of acid spurting from their flesh.  Although no less aggressive than their younger counterparts, wretch titans generally have a much higher survival rate, due to not only their formidable power and size, but the sheer terror they cause when charging at the enemy - few Eyalites would stand and fight against such a foe, particularly when it means standing in a rapidly-growing pool of acid.","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage_sha256":"523e866444049042b829308a115d54149c1b4a526cc3ea5d2f0eea9aeb570b17","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa"},"rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-ashes-urhrok/data/lore/demon.lua","source":"The modified children of emerald, known as the Wretchlings, willingly accept their role as the arrows in Urh'Rok's quiver, and most only live to see a couple of engagements before giving their lives in battle.  Once in a great while, though, one will stand toe-to-toe with the enemy and repeatedly come out on top.  These outstanding fighters, chosen by fate and their own talent, are recalled, then put through a series of tests to ensure that their survival was not due to luck alone.  Roughly 70% of these are then assigned to breeding duties, ensuring that the Wretchling bloodline gets ever stronger as it is forged in the fires of combat; the rest, whether due to sterility, consuming too much resources to sustain their brood, or simply insisting on staying in the fights for which they were created, are nurtured to maturity and once again let loose on the battlefield.  If wretchlings are our arrows, wretch titans are our trebuchet boulders, causing a tremendous amount of damage to the enemy line with their incredible strength and the geysers of acid spurting from their flesh.  Although no less aggressive than their younger counterparts, wretch titans generally have a much higher survival rate, due to not only their formidable power and size, but the sheer terror they cause when charging at the enemy - few Eyalites would stand and fight against such a foe, particularly when it means standing in a rapidly-growing pool of acid.","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage":"绿翡翠的孩子们，酸液树魔，愉快地接受了作为乌鲁洛克之箭的身份，大部分在战死前都只能见证几次战斗。但少数情况下，也会有个体在面对面的厮杀中取得持续的胜利。这些卓越的被命运和他们自身天赋选定的近战专家，将被召回做检测，以确保并非是全然的幸运令其生存。其中约 70% 会被指派承担繁殖任务，让酸液树魔的血统在战火熔炉中不断变得更加强壮；其余的，不论是因为无法生育、消耗过多资源喂养后代，还是坚持留在为之而生的战场上，都会被培育成熟后再次放回战场。如果说酸液树魔是我们的箭矢，那么腐化泰坦就是投石机抛出的巨石，以不可思议的力量和从血肉中喷涌的酸液对敌军战线造成巨大破坏。他们不比酸液树魔杀伤力小，同时生存率要高得多——这不仅仅是因为他们的力量和体积，更是因为他们面对敌人时制造的恐惧——几乎无人能站在他们面前肉搏，尤其是在地表上有不断扩张的强酸池时。","target_preimage_sha256":"523e866444049042b829308a115d54149c1b4a526cc3ea5d2f0eea9aeb570b17","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/manifest.json","observation_identity":"07b768e48623f7e3ba17dbd4832449709c78f63db3fa77ec3f3d68afbea01e45","publication_commit":"0ece410c624e79c49761459487c14bc419fd91fa","result_sha256":"c28cca4d8d9d438f96912145673d74b4a06a17fb65a68786df114bb0fd451cdc","results_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/results.jsonl"}},{"call_locator":"a056c40c6bb49a09a4efd236f6c2cf2065eb9474101c018902a132ada04f1f99","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"368ba81f9792baeb708110174a04de1a7018ac4f81918eab0771d59790537f44","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:104ad8232778010e72f736559c726ea6ba8291265c28de2ecdf2275ec76dc2f2","logical_entry_identity":"72d04dfea4b0f65a3d25713413c4e7531c05a0a24cf580e9180a9cd0335fcfd1","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","proposed_successor_input":{"call_locator":"a056c40c6bb49a09a4efd236f6c2cf2065eb9474101c018902a132ada04f1f99","component":"ashes-urhrok","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:104ad8232778010e72f736559c726ea6ba8291265c28de2ecdf2275ec76dc2f2","logical_entry_identity":"72d04dfea4b0f65a3d25713413c4e7531c05a0a24cf580e9180a9cd0335fcfd1","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","parent_entry_revision_identity":"368ba81f9792baeb708110174a04de1a7018ac4f81918eab0771d59790537f44","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-ashes-urhrok/data/timed_effects.lua","source":"#Target#'s weapon looks less threatening.","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage_sha256":"7473a6c43e060188a1a71f42759c2ccd9fc7c9e750e548ca9cfeb3b91f135834","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa"},"rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-ashes-urhrok/data/timed_effects.lua","source":"#Target#'s weapon looks less threatening.","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage":"#Target#的危险度看起来降低了。","target_preimage_sha256":"7473a6c43e060188a1a71f42759c2ccd9fc7c9e750e548ca9cfeb3b91f135834","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/manifest.json","observation_identity":"671b3fe617e244bac683d755e7112dc40b42602f69cf63d0286dbac0e9c24c52","publication_commit":"0ece410c624e79c49761459487c14bc419fd91fa","result_sha256":"8b0a1e672160f7bb4fc92884e886d4925a803a2b0d89532b58bda4010391c43e","results_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/results.jsonl"}},{"call_locator":"61ed0d1a31856cacc808058f4eca45e1c9c20a8db7cd64a44f2869ccb290f050","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"3703023121b9d40d86a908b8a81d5245dd6401f87fd5180406b2acaa3c93026b","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:104ad8232778010e72f736559c726ea6ba8291265c28de2ecdf2275ec76dc2f2","logical_entry_identity":"eec3715d20e334ef153f0a93bbae939d75ba7873cfa1a5ea74e187acafdab890","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","proposed_successor_input":{"call_locator":"61ed0d1a31856cacc808058f4eca45e1c9c20a8db7cd64a44f2869ccb290f050","component":"ashes-urhrok","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:104ad8232778010e72f736559c726ea6ba8291265c28de2ecdf2275ec76dc2f2","logical_entry_identity":"eec3715d20e334ef153f0a93bbae939d75ba7873cfa1a5ea74e187acafdab890","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","parent_entry_revision_identity":"3703023121b9d40d86a908b8a81d5245dd6401f87fd5180406b2acaa3c93026b","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-ashes-urhrok/overload/data/texts/unlock-corrupter_demonologist.lua","source":"Demons in their invasion of Eyal have abducted natives of the planet and mindwiped them to serve as double agents.\nTrained in the use of the demon's own forces they have created many dark cults to spread fear and terror.\nSome have managed to escape their programming and chose to follow their own desires instead.\n\nYou have defeated countless demons, seen how their essence work, witnessed how to bind demons to your own purpose and can now create new characters with the #LIGHT_GREEN#Demonologist class#WHITE#.\n\nCorruptors are spellcasters, ranged attackers using magic.\nClass features:#YELLOW#\n- Infect your foes with demonic seeds.\n- Bind demonic seeds to your equipment to enhance them.\n- Summon and control demons to do your binding.\n- Blend corrupted magic with a martial shield training to protect yourself and ruin your foes.#WHITE#\n\nCorruptors use \"vim\" to power their special abilities.\nVim is the life force of all beings. It does not regenerate, and can only be stolen from your foes.\n","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage_sha256":"787bd852887e6a3d2969508aea9c37c5fb1af6a9cdfebdc2537c6f3d4072db79","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa"},"rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-ashes-urhrok/overload/data/texts/unlock-corrupter_demonologist.lua","source":"Demons in their invasion of Eyal have abducted natives of the planet and mindwiped them to serve as double agents.\nTrained in the use of the demon's own forces they have created many dark cults to spread fear and terror.\nSome have managed to escape their programming and chose to follow their own desires instead.\n\nYou have defeated countless demons, seen how their essence work, witnessed how to bind demons to your own purpose and can now create new characters with the #LIGHT_GREEN#Demonologist class#WHITE#.\n\nCorruptors are spellcasters, ranged attackers using magic.\nClass features:#YELLOW#\n- Infect your foes with demonic seeds.\n- Bind demonic seeds to your equipment to enhance them.\n- Summon and control demons to do your binding.\n- Blend corrupted magic with a martial shield training to protect yourself and ruin your foes.#WHITE#\n\nCorruptors use \"vim\" to power their special abilities.\nVim is the life force of all beings. It does not regenerate, and can only be stolen from your foes.\n","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage":"在入侵埃亚尔大陆的过程中，恶魔绑架了这颗星球的居民，将他们洗脑后训练为双面间谍。\n\n他们接受使用恶魔之力的训练，并通过黑暗仪式来传播不安与恐慌。\n\n也有一些人成功逃脱了恶魔的控制，选择追随自己的渴望与意志。\n\n你打败了无数的恶魔，掌握了他们本质的运作，见证了如何束缚恶魔为你所用，现在在你创建人物时可以选择新的职业 #LIGHT_GREEN#恶魔使者#WHITE#。\n\n堕落系是施法职业，能使用魔法攻击敌人。\n职业特点：#YELLOW#\n- 向敌人注射恶魔之种\n- 将恶魔种子附着在装备上，以强化装备效果\n- 召唤并控制恶魔\n- 将堕落魔法与盾牌战技结合，保护自己并毁灭敌人。#WHITE#\n\n堕落者使用活力值来施放他们的法术。\n活力是所有生物的生命力量，它不会自己回复，而必须从你的目标身上偷取。\n","target_preimage_sha256":"787bd852887e6a3d2969508aea9c37c5fb1af6a9cdfebdc2537c6f3d4072db79","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/manifest.json","observation_identity":"0985c68bf608f3c32a533054a2dec9461487df71aeadd506a1a38770f373840a","publication_commit":"0ece410c624e79c49761459487c14bc419fd91fa","result_sha256":"24948d18ffbf107917a85cb28c3e83f2425d188f47e6bfdb95ee44d46d12cf7c","results_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-2dd6d21e34b360ebb6d9/results.jsonl"}},{"call_locator":"98e482b047f6d679043a0e22a6d2352eaa9b81d455c237f040aa5dcf3a4dcc20","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"39754d3147f4c1e1d3cee89b6b2b57b4071aec6ad58d9ab7bcf9b2fbcfdf6212","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:104ad8232778010e72f736559c726ea6ba8291265c28de2ecdf2275ec76dc2f2","logical_entry_identity":"b3e9c1625c81dcd9ce01c3101ad9562cb79a8f85e487ffff5144ef9474834a1b","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","proposed_successor_input":{"c